      "notes": [
        {
          "id": "n-20260915-arizona-january",
          "date": "2026-09-15",
          "by": "family",
          "text": "Elena has chosen the Jan 23, 2027 on-campus audition in Tucson, passing over the Sep 26 and Oct 9 in-person dates. This does NOT affect first-year Dance Merit talent aid: Arizona's Fall 2027 page states applicants \"need to complete their application by November 1, regardless of their audition date\", and Jan 23 is still an in-person audition, so she stays eligible (only video-only auditioners are excluded until year 2). The Nov 1 application deadline therefore becomes the thing that protects the aid. Registration requirements for the January date are not published — confirm with the department. Jan 23 in Tucson pairs with Boston Conservatory's Los Angeles audition on Jan 24."
        }
      ]
    },
